sequenceDiagram
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant AC as AuthController
    participant AS as AuthService
    participant UR as UserRepository
    participant JWT as JwtService
    participant RT as RefreshTokenService
    participant ES as EmailService
    participant DB as MySQL (auth_db)
    participant MAIL as Mailpit/SMTP

    Note over FE,MAIL: Registration Flow
    FE->>GW: POST /api/auth/register
    GW->>AC: Forward (public path)
    AC->>AS: register(request)
    AS->>UR: existsByEmailIgnoreCase()
    UR->>DB: SELECT
    DB-->>UR: false
    AS->>UR: existsByUsernameIgnoreCase()
    UR->>DB: SELECT
    DB-->>UR: false
    AS->>UR: save(user)
    UR->>DB: INSERT INTO users
    DB-->>UR: saved
    AS->>ES: sendWelcomeEmail()
    ES->>MAIL: Send welcome email
    AS->>JWT: generateAccessToken(user)
    JWT-->>AS: accessToken
    AS->>RT: createForUser(user)
    RT->>DB: INSERT INTO refresh_tokens
    AS-->>AC: AuthResponse
    AC-->>GW: 200 + tokens + user
    GW-->>FE: Response

    Note over FE,MAIL: Login Flow
    FE->>GW: POST /api/auth/login
    GW->>AC: Forward (public path)
    AC->>AS: login(request)
    AS->>AS: loginRateLimiter.checkAndIncrement()
    AS->>UR: findByEmailIgnoreCase()
    UR->>DB: SELECT
    DB-->>UR: User
    AS->>AS: passwordEncoder.matches()
    AS->>ES: sendLoginNotificationEmail()
    AS->>JWT: generateAccessToken(user)
    AS->>RT: createForUser(user)
    AS-->>AC: AuthResponse
    AC-->>GW: 200 + tokens
    GW-->>FE: Response

    Note over FE,MAIL: Admin Console - Remove Admin Role
    FE->>GW: PUT /api/auth/admin/console/admins/{id}/remove-role
    GW->>GW: JWT validation + ADMIN role check
    GW->>AC: Forward with X-Headers
    AC->>AS: AdminConsoleService.removeAdminRole()
    AS->>AS: Assert caller is default admin
    AS->>UR: findById(adminId)
    UR->>DB: SELECT
    AS->>AS: Assert target is not default admin
    AS->>UR: save(user with role=READER)
    UR->>DB: UPDATE users SET role='READER'
    AS-->>AC: UserResponse
    AC-->>GW: 200 + updated user
    GW-->>FE: Response
